# 逆転裁判 (Gyakuten Saiban, AGB-ASBJ): the game's own numbers for its characters, as the script has them
# (16-bit, the low byte first, so 00C0 is written C000). The whole font, 1,351 characters: read off numbered
# sheets of the cartridge's glyphs in code order (`yomikata rom-font`: 0x1CF12C + 128 x the code, four 4-bit
# tiles a glyph). 186 of them were read in play before that, in sentences, and all agree with the sheets; the
# others have been read once, by one reader. One glyph (0x05B3, a filled square) is left out.
